<article id="post-1688" class="post-1688 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-cse-issuer-stories tag-goviex-uranium-inc">
	
	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/featured-listing-goviex-uranium-gxu/" aria-hidden="true">
	<img width="670" height="335" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/Pic_Blog_20150224_Goviex_TeamSite_web.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Featured Listing: Goviex Uranium (GXU)" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/Pic_Blog_20150224_Goviex_TeamSite_web.jpg 670w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/Pic_Blog_20150224_Goviex_TeamSite_web-300x150.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 670px) 100vw, 670px" data-attachment-id="1698" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/featured-listing-goviex-uranium-gxu/pic_blog_20150224_goviex_teamsite_web/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/Pic_Blog_20150224_Goviex_TeamSite_web.jpg" data-orig-size="670,335" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="Pic_Blog_20150224_Goviex_TeamSite_web" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/Pic_Blog_20150224_Goviex_TeamSite_web.jpg" />	</a>

	
	<header class="entry-header">
				<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="cat-links"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-issuer-stories/" rel="category tag">CSE Issuer Stories</a></span>
		</div>
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/featured-listing-goviex-uranium-gxu/" rel="bookmark">Featured Listing: Goviex Uranium (GXU)</a></h1>
		<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="entry-date"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/featured-listing-goviex-uranium-gxu/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2015-02-25T11:14:46-05:00">February 25, 2015</time></a></span> <span class="byline"><span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://blog.thecse.com/author/sparxpg/" rel="author">Hamish Khamisa</a></span></span>		</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

		<div class="entry-content">
		<p><img decoding="async" data-attachment-id="1692" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/featured-listing-goviex-uranium-gxu/pic_blog_20150224_goviex_gxu_logo/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/Pic_Blog_20150224_Goviex_GXU_logo.gif" data-orig-size="244,122" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="Pic_Blog_20150224_Goviex_GXU_logo" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/Pic_Blog_20150224_Goviex_GXU_logo.gif" class="border-gray alignright wp-image-1692 size-full" src="https://cseblog.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/Pic_Blog_20150224_Goviex_GXU_logo.gif" alt="Goviex Uranium" width="244" height="122" />The combination of a growing global population, increased dependence on electronic devices and concern over environmental impacts of fossil fuels are three of major challenges facing governments around the world. For countries that have turned or are turning to nuclear power to generate electricity, stable access to uranium is key. Meeting that need is the focus of CSE listed firm Goviex Uranium (GXU).</p>
<p>Goviex Uranium debuted on the CSE in 2014 with an IPO and has been working towards the development of their flagship project in Niger, the Madaouela Project. Recently, Goviex Uranium’s CEO, Daniel Major, completed a video interview (see below) with BTV where he discussed their flagship project in more detail.</p>
<p>Representatives from Goviex Uranium will be at PDAC 2015 in Toronto and are scheduled to present at the CSE-sponsored investor luncheon (for more details click here).</p>
<p>To learn more about Goviex Uranium, visit their website at <a href="http://www.goviex.com/">http://www.goviex.com/</a> .</p>
<p><script src="https://video.b-tv.com/players/uR6uFS8H-oN97cVjN.js" type="text/javascript"></script></p>
