		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-1-now-live/" rel="bookmark">The CSE Quarterly &#8211; Issue 1 is now live!</a></h1>
		<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="entry-date"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/cse-quarterly-issue-1-now-live/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2014-05-04T21:11:16-04:00">May 4, 2014</time></a></span> <span class="byline"><span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://blog.thecse.com/author/administrator/" rel="author">CSE Blogger</a></span></span>		</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

		<div class="entry-content">
		<p>The CSE is proud to present its first ever quarterly publication &#8211; the CSE Quarterly &#8211; Issue 1 is now live! The publication profiles some of the CSE&#8217;s most dynamic listed companies on the exchange, including the following listings:</p>
<p>RESAAS Services Inc. (RSS)<br />
Gener8 Media Corp. (GNR)<br />
Enertopia Corp. (TOP)<br />
Abattis Bioceuticals Corp. (ATT)<br />
Next Gen Metals Inc. (N)<br />
Urbana Corporation (URB)<br />
Brisio Innovations Inc. (BZI)</p>
